# Normalize line endings; POSIX scripts must stay LF even on Windows checkouts (autocrlf=true),
# otherwise `sh` fails on the carriage return. Every text file is checked out as LF: Prettier and
# dotnet format expect LF, so a fresh Windows clone must not turn check red (spec 0001, VERIFY F-1).
* text=auto eol=lf
scripts/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text
*.yml text
*.json text
